#fc-box([Good to know], [
  - *Generated files are overwritten* on every run: `data/clean/`, `output/plots/`,
    `output/tables/`, `output/data.json`. Change the script, never the output.
  - *`data.json` is shared.* Every analysis script reads it, merges in its own numbers
    (`modifyList`) and writes it back. Namespace keys by dataset (`stats$occupation$…`)
    so scripts don't clash. Always use `auto_unbox = TRUE` (else Typst gets `[1432]`).
  - *Order:* clean, analyse, compile. Each script run also updates `_tinytrail.yaml`.
])

